    "chunk_text": "The reveal was followed by an insightful presentation detailing the unique lifestyles, designs, locations, and investment potential, along with easy and flexible payment plans, presented by Home Lands Group Head of Business Development and Marketing Operations Ashinsanie Weerasinghe.\n\nAdding further excitement, Home Lands unveiled its major promotional campaign for 2026: \u201cHome Lands Mercedes-Benz Draw 2026 - Choose Your Lifestyle, Drive Your Dream.\u201d All customers who purchase a unit between 1 January 2026 and 31 December 2026 stand a chance to win a C-Class Mercedes-Benz, reinforcing Home Lands\u2019 commitment to rewarding customer trust.\n\nBeyond the project launches, the event also celebrated a significant milestone with the Key Handing Over Ceremony for Greendale Retirement Leisure Village and Cressida Resort Apartments, Athurugiriya where the first set of keys were ceremoniously handed over to residents. This moment symbolised Home Lands\u2019 dedication to delivering on promises and timelines, strengthening the trust placed in the brand by its customers.\n\nIn addition to the newly launched projects, attendees had the opportunity to explore other prestigious developments by Home Lands, including Pentara Residencies - Thummulla Handiya, Oceana Resort Apartments and Villas - Wadduwa, Bayfonte Marina - Negombo, and Waterdale - Colombo 07. Customers also experienced Home Lands\u2019 exclusive VR walkthrough technology, allowing them to virtually explore resort apartment units in immersive detail."
  },
