    "chunk_text": "To be fair, blaming only the present Government for the societal, political and economic wounds is unreasonable as they were a collective result of all past governments and opposition parties.\u00a0 In the current political setting, the present Government came to power to resolve inequalities and \u00a0irregularities but appears to be worse than the past regimes, fearlessly navigating their political ideology \u2013 e.g. challenging the decisions of the Constitutional Council, (thanks to Yahapalana Government for decentralising power and bringing in severable\u00a0favourable reforms), exploiting indirect avenues to discredit the office of the Attorney General and unscrupulously protecting the supporters.\u00a0If this trend continues will be a dangerous irrevocable ploy which will reorient the minds of Gen Z and Gen Alpha."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2026-02-14-colombotelegraphcom-ffcc68c7",
