    "chunk_text": "Wild Mist Water\u2019s premium positioning is expected to appeal to those who appreciate minimalism, discipline, intentional living and those who view wellbeing as a non-negotiable lifestyle choice. Production takes place at a globally certified, export-grade food manufacturing facility in Sri Lanka, with a strong emphasis on quality-first sourcing and disciplined processes.\n\nWhile the initial focus is on establishing the brand locally through selective distribution, discussions are already under way for export to Australia, Malaysia and Singapore, markets that align with Wild Mist Water\u2019s emphasis on intentional living, sensory refinement and quiet luxury.\n\nBorn in Sri Lanka, once known to the world as Ceylon, Wild Mist Water represents a modern expression of an ancient sensibility \u2013 a quiet, confident step towards reintroducing the island\u2019s botanical heritage to a global audience, one mindful cup at a time.\n\nComBank makes history as first bank in Sri Lanka to enable Google Pay for Mastercard cardholders\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
