    "description": "ComBank makes history as first bank in Sri Lanka to enable Google Pay for Mastercard cardholders",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/combank-makes-history-as-first-bank-in-sri-lanka-to-enable-google-pay-for-mastercard-cardholders/",
