    "description": "Giants in our backyard: Why Sri Lanka\u2019s Blue Whales matter to the world",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/giants-in-our-backyard-why-sri-lankas-blue-whales-matter-to-the-world/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
