    "chunk_size_bytes": 1158,
    "chunk_text": "Megha Nadha unveils \u2018new concept\u2019 for live music in Sri Lanka\n\nMEGHA NADHA, a premium signature live concert experience, was officially launched at Waters Edge, Colombo, setting a fresh benchmark in Sri Lanka\u2019s entertainment scene. The concept offers an immersive musical journey blending timeless artistry with contemporary energy, featuring two fully live bands.\n\nThe concert brings together a curated lineup of six artistes: two legendary performers, two iconic 1990s stars, and two viral contemporary acts \u2013 uniting nostalgia with modern musical expression.\n\nDeveloped by award-winning event manager H.P. Kasun Eranga Gunawardena \u2013 recently honoured as \u201cGlobal Icon of the Year \u2013 Event Manager (Sri Lanka)\u201d at the Global Icon Awards 2025\u2014MEGHA NADHA is produced by CCC Events (Pvt) Ltd. Designed for both indoor and outdoor venues, the experience promises to connect deeply with audiences as Sri Lanka\u2019s live music scene continues to evolve.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
