    "chunk_text": "Bubbles & Beyond wins Golden Business Excellence Award 2025\n\nSri Lankan luxury wellness brand Bubbles & Beyond has been named the winner of the\u00a0Excellence in Luxury Ayurvedic & Artisanal Skincare Innovation of the Year \u2013 2025\u00a0at the Golden Business Excellence Awards. The ceremony was held recently at the City of Dreams, Cinnamon Life.\n\nFounded in 2023 by Dr. Wathsadani Wijayasundara, a medical doctor with a deep-rooted Ayurvedic heritage, the brand distinguishes itself through clinically informed formulations inspired by traditional botanical wisdom. Each product is handcrafted in small batches, merging medical precision with ancestral knowledge to transform daily self-care into a ritual of purity and purpose.\n\nIn just two years, Bubbles & Beyond has emerged as a premium artisanal label celebrated for its authenticity and innovation. As global demand rises for science-backed natural skincare, this national recognition solidifies the brand\u2019s position as a leader bridging Sri Lankan heritage with contemporary luxury.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
