    "description": "Official Olympic flooring provider, Gerflor partners with WIDAC Commercial Interiors to introduce world-class solutions to Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Official-Olympic-flooring-provider-Gerflor-partners-with-WIDAC-Commercial-Interiors-to-introduce-world-class-solutions-to-Sri-Lanka/14-788410",
    "lang": "en",
