    "chunk_size_bytes": 1721,
    "chunk_text": "Gerflor, headquartered in France and present in more than 100 countries, is globally respected for its innovation in resilient flooring systems designed for professional environments. Its solutions are widely used in sports facilities, hospitals, educational institutions, and public buildings, spaces where safety, hygiene, and durability cannot be compromised. Notably, Gerflor has been the official flooring supplier to the Olympic Games since 1976.\n\nEqually significant is Gerflor\u2019s range of healthcare flooring solutions, developed to meet the demanding requirements of hospitals and medical facilities. These floors are engineered to support infection control, ease of cleaning, and long-term performance, key considerations in clinical environments where hygiene, safety, and reliability are critical. With increasing investments in healthcare infrastructure across Sri Lanka, the partnership offers timely access to flooring systems designed specifically for these critical settings.\n\nSpeaking on the strategic importance of the partnership, Gerflor Regional Sales Head\u00a0 Benjamin Le Toux said: \u201cSri Lanka represents a market with growing expectations for performance-led, specialised environments. Partnering with WIDAC Commercial Interiors allows us to bring Gerflor\u2019s global expertise closer to local projects, supported by a team that understands execution, standards, and long-term value.\u201d\n\nThis partnership also strengthens WIDAC\u2019s ability to support a wide range of local stakeholders, from educational institutions and healthcare providers to developers, consultants, and contractors, by offering flooring systems that align with international benchmarks while being adapted to local conditions."
