    "description": "EDB invites potential and SME exporters to strategic workshop on risk management and incoterms",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/EDB-invites-potential-and-SME-exporters-to-strategic-workshop-on-risk-management-and-incoterms/34-788413",
