    "md5": "56a6ee9e0adb8cde0c558529577b0407",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1209,
    "chunk_text": "Mohan Ratnayake joins Lee Hedges Board\n\nLee Hedges PLC has appointed Mohan Ratnayake to its Board as an Independent Non-Executive Director.\n\nRatnayake is a Fellow Member of the Chartered Institute of Management Accountants UK and has read for an MBA. He was the Chairman of the Committee which issued Sri Lanka\u2019s first internationally listed USD Bond by a corporate entity \u2013 Sri Lanka Telecom PLC (SLT) \u2013 which traded on the Singapore Stock Exchange, for the expansion of SLT and Mobitel. This was when the sovereign had not been rated by international rating agencies.\n\nHe currently serves as the Managing Director of Colonial Motors Ceylon Ltd \u2013 agents for Mazda Motor Corporation Japan. He also serves as an Independent Non-Executive Director of C M Holdings PLC, ACL Plastics PLC, Lanka Tiles PLC, Swisstek Ceylon PLC, Serendib Land PLC and UB Finance PLC.\n\nHe also serves on several Boards and chairs Audit Committees, IRMC and other statutory committees. He has expertise in the fields of tea exports, tea plantations, telecommunications and the motor industry. He held the position of Deputy Chairman of a listed financial institution falling under the purview of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka."
