    "md5": "1d447ffffac718825ca28b17ad816b86",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 982,
    "chunk_text": "Yanika Amarasekera joins Vallibel One Board\n\nVallibel One PLC has appointed Yanika Amarasekera to its Board as an Independent Non-Executive Director.\n\nAmarasekera holds an MSc in Entrepreneurship, Innovation and Management from Imperial College Business School, London, and dual Bachelor of Arts degrees in Political Economy and Mass Communication (with a focus on Digital Marketing) from the University of California, Berkeley.\n\nShe is the Founder and Chair of Silver Aisle \u2013 Sri Lanka\u2019s first online wedding registry and luxury gifting platform for all occasions, launched in 2019. She currently serves as Chairperson and Chief Executive Officer of Silver Aisle Ltd.\n\nShe previously served as an Independent Non-Executive Director of LB Finance PLC and as a Non-Executive Director of Multi Finance PLC and Greener Water Ltd.\n\nShe was named to the Forbes 30-Under-30 Asia 2025 list within the retail and e-commerce segment in recognition of her work as Founder of Silver Aisle."
