    "chunk_size_bytes": 1305,
    "chunk_text": "Widely regarded as the Sri Lankan hospitality brand, Cinnamon Hotels and resorts leads as the title sponsor, with Jayaflava showcasing four of its seventeen hotels and resorts, Cinnamon Grand Colombo, Cinnamon Wild Yala, Cinnamon Bentota Beach Signature Selection and Cinnamon Life at City of Dreams.\n\n\u201cIt is our duty as a Sri Lankan brand to support local stories that connect with a global audience and attract that audience to this magnificent island. Jayaflava is such a story and a salute to our treasured gastronomical traditions\u201d added Cinnamon Hotels and Resorts Vice President brand excellence, Brandon Ingram.\n\nThe media was privileged to view a snippet of an upcoming episode where Tasha visits Jaffna and uncovers a hitherto unknown, vibrantly colorful and inventive world of the Jaffna kite festival, catches and later releases mud crabs down Gangewadiya and enjoys a breakfast of boiled manioc with toddy with Rockland Distilleries Group Managing Director, Amal de Silva Wijeratne who explains that toddy is one of the oldest spirits of the world, tapped only in Sri Lanka, to his knowledge.\n\nMastercard joins Jayaflava as main sponsor, while Flying Ravana Adventure park comes in as a sponsor. Advertisers include Noritake, SriLankan Airlines and the Sri Lanka Tourism Promotion Bureau."
