    "description": "IDL emerges champion at CIPM Great HR Quiz 2026 on debut appearance",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/idl-emerges-champion-at-cipm-great-hr-quiz-2026-on-debut-appearance/",
    "lang": "en",
