    "description": "\u2018Kaanaa Inbam Kaninthathaeno\u2019 \u2013 Splendid \u201cSinging in the Rain\u201d Song by TA Moti and Susheela in \u201cSabash Meena\u201d \u266b",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=47426",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
    "time_ut": 1771530060.0,
