    "description": "IMF MD meets private sector leaders; gets insights to SME development in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/IMF-MD-meets-private-sector-leaders-gets-insights-to-SME-development-in-Sri-Lanka/34-788582",
    "lang": "en",
